{
  "origin": "James Royal, MarketWise, relaying Wall Street Journal reporting; MarketWise publication date 2026-07-28. The original Wall Street Journal publication date is not stated.",
  "note": "Royal says the Journal reported that NVIDIA was working on a $350 billion deal to finance OpenAI's purchases of NVIDIA chips. This is a report of prospective customer financing, consistent with the July 27 report of preliminary negotiations that could change or collapse (e717); it does not establish that NVIDIA has signed a binding commitment. If such financing is ultimately agreed, it could support OpenAI's ability to purchase NVIDIA chips while increasing NVIDIA's financial exposure to a customer. The reported amount is not itself an NVIDIA order or revenue figure, and this relay does not specify that the financing covers the proposed Ohio project. It therefore does not change the existing assessment of whether a binding Ohio-project commitment will be entered by December 31, 2026.",
  "limitations": [
    "The original Journal report and its publication date are not supplied, so the relay does not establish the report's full context.",
    "The financing structure, terms, signing status, and whether it specifically covers purchases for the proposed Ohio project are not stated."
  ],
